# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Human subjects material. Never commit any of this.
# The 30 practitioner interviews were given under a consent agreement that does
# not cover publication. Transcripts, audio, notes and anything derived from
# them that could identify a participant stay off this repository permanently.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
interviews/
transcripts/
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.wav
*.vtt
*.srt
*consent*
*participant*
*interview*
*_PRIVATE*
*_IDENTIFIED*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw captures. Excluded for size and because redistributing whole job pages
# and archived HTML raises copyright and terms-of-service questions that the
# derived, coded data does not. The source_url and capture timestamp in the
# public data let anyone retrieve the same pages themselves.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/raw/*
!data/raw/.gitkeep
*_html/
*_rendered/
*_xhr/
*.html
*.warc
*.warc.gz

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working data. Only data/public/ is released; data/processed/ is the
# intermediate stage and may still contain full advertisement text.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
!data/processed/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors and operating systems
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*~
~$*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Manuscript drafts. The paper belongs with the journal, not here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.docx
*.doc
*.rtf
manuscript/
